WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.990
«La fin du monde», or «la fin du mois»?

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.210
The end of the world,

3
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:05.910
or the end of the month?

4
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.330
A slogan set one against the other.

5
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.570
In 2018, a planned rise in fuel tax helped

6
00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.770
spark the «gilets jaunes» protests.

7
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:19.120
A year later, 150
citizens drawn by lot met:

8
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.720
the «Convention citoyenne pour le climat».

9
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.510
So who should save the planet:

10
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.370
you, the government, or big business?

11
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.130
In this mission, you'll read where
France's electricity comes from,

12
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.340
in one bar.

13
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.740
Then you'll weigh «chaque
geste compte» against the view

14
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:37.620
that states and big firms must act.

15
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.160
Your mission: decide who should act,

16
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.190
and back it with a date or a figure.
